    '<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-500/10 to-amber-500/10 border border-rose-500/40 rounded-2xl p-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation text-rose-400 text-xl mt-0.5"></i><div class="text-[11px] text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"><b class="text-rose-400">⚠️ Legal:</b> No spam, mass DM, fake reviews, scraping. GDPR · CCPA · CAN-SPAM compliant. Only consent-based sharing.</div></div></div>' +
